THOUGHT: I’ll create a self-contained standard-library implementation with shared SQLite persistence, three supervised HTTP nodes, REST auth/workspaces/channels/messages/invitations/reactions, WebSocket subscriptions, and a minimal SPA. This establishes the broad contract quickly without external dependencies.

